<li>&lt;a href="Saos%20cheddar"&gt;Saus Cheddar&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Chile%20con%20queso"&gt;Chile con queso&lt;/a&gt; - nduweni tekstur sing alus, krim, lan misuwur banget ing Amérika Kidul-kulon</li>
