<doc id="182430" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182430" title="Kabiskopan Agung Dili">
Kabiskopan Agung Dili

Kabiskopan Agung Dili (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Archidiœcesis Diliensis, #ALIH) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; paling tuwa ing &lt;a href="Timor%20Wetan"&gt;Timor Wetan&lt;/a&gt; lan berpusat ing &lt;a href="Dili"&gt;Dili&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan Agung Dili didegake ing 4 September 1940. Ing taun 1983, &lt;a href="Carlos%20Filipe%20Ximenes%20Belo"&gt;Carlos Filipe Ximenes Belo&lt;/a&gt;, S.D.B., nyekel tugas minangka Administrator Apostolik Kabiskopan Agung Dili. 700.000 umat Katulik ing kabeh &lt;a href="Timor%20Wetan"&gt;Timor Wetan&lt;/a&gt; dipérang dadi 30 paroki lan diurus dening 71 imam.
<h2>Kronologi</h2>
<ul>
<li>Didegake minangka Kabiskopan Dili ing 4 September 1940, misah saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Makau"&gt;Kabiskopan Makau&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>Didathengi dening &lt;a href="Paus%20Yohanes%20Paulus%20II"&gt;Paus Yohanes Paulus II&lt;/a&gt; ing 12 Oktober 1989, nalika &lt;a href="Timor%20Wetan"&gt;Timor Wetan&lt;/a&gt; isih bagean saka Indonesia</li>
<li>Ditingkatake dadi Kabiskopan Agung Dili ing 11 September 2019</li>
</ul>
