<doc id="182431" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182431" title="Chutney bawang">
Chutney bawang

Bawang putih chutney, uga diarani lahsun chutney, lahsun ki chutney, lehsun chutney lan bellulli chutney iku salah sawijining olahan &lt;a href="chutney"&gt;chutney&lt;/a&gt;, asalé saka anak bawana India, digawe saka &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt; seger, &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt; garing utawa seger, &lt;a href="Kacang%20brol"&gt;kacang tanah&lt;/a&gt; lan cabe ijo utawa abang. &lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;Cumin&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Asem%20jawa"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt; uga kadhangkala digunakake minangka bahan. Iki disiapake ing wangun udan lan garing. Varietas teles digawe karo klapa parut sing seger lan biasane disedhiyakake langsung sawise disiapake.
<h2>Guna</h2>
Guna.
Bawang putih chutney digunakake kanggo masak ing akeh &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; (utamané Maharashtra, Gujarat, Punjab, &lt;a href="Rajasthan"&gt;Rajasthan&lt;/a&gt; lan Karnataka lor) lan omah-omahé &lt;a href="Olahan%20Pakistan"&gt;Pakistan&lt;/a&gt;. Asring dipangan karo &lt;a href="bhakri"&gt;bhakri&lt;/a&gt; sing seger lan panas (&lt;a href="Roti%20India"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; datar tanpa ragi sing digawe saka glepung gandum kayata &lt;a href="Kaoliang"&gt;jowar&lt;/a&gt; (sorgum), bajra (gedang mutiara), nachni (gedang driji), lsp.). Chutney bawang putih kadhangkala dadi iringan kanggo &lt;a href="Chaat"&gt;chaats&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="khandvi"&gt;khandvi&lt;/a&gt;. 
