<doc id="182433" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182433" title="Ruchanki">
Ruchanki

Ruchanki - &lt;a href="Racuchy"&gt;racuszki&lt;/a&gt; minangka salah sawijining olahan saka &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; (nyedhiyakake rasa &lt;a href="Pangrasa"&gt;asem&lt;/a&gt;) utawa &lt;a href="Kuw%C3%A9%20spons"&gt;kue bolu&lt;/a&gt; (rasa manis), &lt;a href="Nggor%C3%A8ng"&gt;goreng&lt;/a&gt; panas ing minyak. 
Sadurungé, ruchanki diprodhuksi saka sisa adonan roti. Versi &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; iki populer dipangan tinimbang roti kanggo &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt; inter alia. Ruchanki sing dipanggang saka &lt;a href="glepung%20gandum"&gt;glepung gandum&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Khamir"&gt;ragi&lt;/a&gt; sacara tradisional dipanggang kanggo &lt;a href="karnaval"&gt;karnaval&lt;/a&gt;. Iki disedhiyakake panas, &lt;a href="Gula%20alus"&gt;ditambahake gula bubuk&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; putih. Ing Kashubia iki disuguhake karo &lt;a href="apel"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt;. 
Ruchanki kadhaptar ing dhaptar produk tradisional &lt;a href="Provinsi%20Pomerania"&gt;Provinsi Pomerania&lt;/a&gt;. Dhaptar resmi nyatakake, &lt;a href="Dhiam%C3%A8ter"&gt;diameter&lt;/a&gt; rata-rata ruchanki kudu antara 5 lan 7 cm lan kekandelane 0,5 cm. 
