Vikariat Apostolik Brunéi Darussalam

Vikariat Apostolik Brunei Darussalam (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Apostolicus Vicariatus Bruneiensis, &lt;a href="basa%20Malayu"&gt;Malayu&lt;/a&gt;: Kerasulan Vikariat Brunei) yaiku yuridiksi grejawi &lt;a href="Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; sing ngeliputi kawasan &lt;a href="Brunei"&gt;Brunei&lt;/a&gt; lan dikepalai dening vikaris apostolik, sing sapisan dianakake dening Biskop &lt;a href="Cornelius%20Sim"&gt;Cornelius Sim&lt;/a&gt; nganti Mei 2021.
