<doc id="182577" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182577" title="Charquicán">
Charquicán

Charquicán minangka &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;panganan rebus&lt;/a&gt; sing populer ing &lt;a href="Cil%C3%A9"&gt;Chili&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Peru"&gt;Peru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bolivia"&gt;Bolivia&lt;/a&gt; lan negara liya ing wilayah Andes, kayata wilayah Cuyo, &lt;a href="Arg%C3%A8ntina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;. Sajian sing padha dipangan ing Lor Lor Argentina diarani Charquisillo, sajian digawe saka ch'arki lan nasi.
Charquicán digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8ndh%C3%A8ng"&gt;ch'arki&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenthang"&gt;kentang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="waluh"&gt;waluh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jagung"&gt;jagung putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; lan kadang &lt;a href="Kapri"&gt;polong&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="jagung"&gt;jagung&lt;/a&gt;. Iki asale digawe saka daging llama sing garing lan asin utawa daging sapi. Versi Charquicán Chili modern digawe nganggo daging sapi cincang lan endhog goreng.

