<doc id="182606" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182606" title="Empadão">
Empadão

Empadão minangka panganan tradisional &lt;a href="Olahan%20Portugis"&gt;Portugis&lt;/a&gt;, uga misuwur ing Brasil. Iki minangka olahan sing digawe ing &lt;a href="oven"&gt;oven&lt;/a&gt; sing bisa ngemot &lt;a href="daging%20abang"&gt;daging abang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt;, tuna, iwak kod lan &lt;a href="Tetedhan%20seganten"&gt;panganan laut&lt;/a&gt; ing antarane lapisan &lt;a href="Kenthang%20uleg"&gt;kentang tumbuk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="roti"&gt;roti&lt;/a&gt; utawa ing jero glepung gandum. &lt;a href="pasta"&gt;pasta&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan versi kentang remukan daging lemah luwih tradisional digunakake, padha karo &lt;a href="Pai%20pondhok"&gt;pai Shepherd&lt;/a&gt; Inggris.
Isi biasane saka &lt;a href="Sofrito"&gt;refogado&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Daging%20giling"&gt;lemah abang / irisan daging&lt;/a&gt; utawa codfish karo &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;papak&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Tomat"&gt;Tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jagung%20manis"&gt;jagung manis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kapri"&gt;kacang ijo&lt;/a&gt; lan requeijão uga digunakake. Ing salah siji resep, Empadão digawe mung nggunakake pão ralado (roti digiling) lan endhog minangka ngisi sing banjur dimasak ing oven kaya &lt;a href="Pudhing"&gt;puding&lt;/a&gt;. Zaitun uga digunakake minangka topping.
