Khanom mo kaeng

Khanom mo kaeng (#ALIH,]) iku salah sawijining olahan panganan cuci mulut tradisional Thailand. Iku padha karo custard endhog utawa jenis flan. Khanom mo kaeng digawe nganggo &lt;a href="santen"&gt;santen&lt;/a&gt;, endhog (pitik utawa bebek), &lt;a href="Gula%20jawa"&gt;gula aren, gula&lt;/a&gt; putih, uyah, &lt;a href="Brambang"&gt;bawang bombay&lt;/a&gt; lan lenga sethithik. Ana macem-macem variasi khanom mo kaeng. Jinis pati sing digunakake biasane talas, nanging kadhangkala digunakake &lt;a href="kacang%20ijo"&gt;kacang ijo&lt;/a&gt; kulit, &lt;a href="Wiji%20trat%C3%A9"&gt;wiji lotus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ket%C3%A9la%20rambat"&gt;kentang manis&lt;/a&gt;, utawa pati liyane. 
