<doc id="182621" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182621" title="Chả cá Lã Vọng">
Chả cá Lã Vọng

Cha ca La Vong (Chả cá Lã Vọng ing basa Vietnam) ya iku salah sawijining olahan panganan iwak panggang &lt;a href="Olahan%20Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, asalé saka &lt;a href="Hanoi"&gt;Hanoi&lt;/a&gt;. Panganan iki sacara tradisional digawe nganggo &lt;a href="Baung"&gt;hemibagrus&lt;/a&gt; (utawa ca lang ing basa Vietnam), yaiku genus lele. Iwak kasebut dipotong dadi potongan-potongan lan diasinake ing saus adhedhasar &lt;a href="Kunir"&gt;kunyit&lt;/a&gt;, sing asring kalebu &lt;a href="Trasi"&gt;terasi&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="K%C3%A9cap%20iwak"&gt;saus iwak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;jahe&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;cabe&lt;/a&gt;. Kadhangkala, &lt;a href="Kumkuma"&gt;saffron&lt;/a&gt; digunakake tinimbang kunir. Banjur &lt;a href="Panggang"&gt;dibakar&lt;/a&gt; entheng ing &lt;a href="areng"&gt;areng&lt;/a&gt;. Piring kasebut disedhiyakake ing wajan panas sing dilapisi saus marinade lan jamu, utamane &lt;a href="dill"&gt;dill&lt;/a&gt;. Jamu liyane, kayata &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;scallions&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Selasih"&gt;basil&lt;/a&gt;, bisa uga kalebu. Dipangan karo &lt;a href="Soun"&gt;mi bihun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Vermicelli"&gt;(&lt;/a&gt; bún ing basa Vietnam) lan &lt;a href="Kacang%20brol"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt;. Cha Ca La Vong dianggep minangka panganan sing &lt;a href="%C3%88nak"&gt;enak&lt;/a&gt; ing Vietnam, amarga meh eksklusif disedhiyakake ing restoran lan ora ditemokake ing &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan jalanan&lt;/a&gt;. 
