Bánh gối

Bánh gối (&lt;a href="Basa%20Vi%C3%A8tnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;: Kue bantal), uga dikenal minangka Bánh xếp, Bánh quai vạc, iku &lt;a href="pangsit"&gt;pangsit&lt;/a&gt; regional Vietnam. Piring kasebut minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan jalanan&lt;/a&gt; umum ing Vietnam. Iki &lt;a href="yau%20gok"&gt;yau gok&lt;/a&gt; versi Vietnam saka Hong Kong.
Struktur utama bánh gối biyasa dibumboni &lt;a href="daging"&gt;daging&lt;/a&gt; giling, &lt;a href="jamur"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vermicelli"&gt;bihun&lt;/a&gt;, lan sayuran potong dadu kayata &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kohlrabi"&gt;kohlrabi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bengkowang"&gt;jicama&lt;/a&gt; (kaya bahan &lt;a href="ch%E1%BA%A3%20gi%C3%B2"&gt;chả giò&lt;/a&gt;); kadhangkala digunakake &lt;a href="Endhog%20godhog"&gt;endhog godhok&lt;/a&gt; lan irisan &lt;a href="Sosis%20China"&gt;sosis Cina&lt;/a&gt;. Dibungkus dadi &lt;a href="Adhonan"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; sing digulung tipis lan digoreng. Kanggo kue, isi bánh gối ana &lt;a href="Kacang%20ijo"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; ijo, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Krambil"&gt;klapa&lt;/a&gt; kuretase.
