<doc id="182637" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182637" title="Puttu">
Puttu

Pittu (Tamil ; Malayalam ; Sinhala) utawa puttu (pocapan [ˈPuttu]) yaiku olahan sarapan sing dipangan ing negara-negara &lt;a href="India%20Kidul"&gt;India Selatan ing&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Masakan%20Kerala"&gt;Kerala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tamil%20Nadu"&gt;Tamil Nadu&lt;/a&gt; lan bagean &lt;a href="Karnataka"&gt;Karnataka&lt;/a&gt;, uga &lt;a href="C%C3%A8ylon"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt;. Puttu tegese "bagean" ing Malayalam. Iki digawe saka silinder &lt;a href="kukus"&gt;kukus&lt;/a&gt; saka beras sing dilapis nganggo parutan klapa, kadang-kadang nganggo isi sing legi utawa gurih. Puttu disajikake kanthi panas karo lawuh sing legi kayata gula aren utawa &lt;a href="gedhang"&gt;gedhang&lt;/a&gt;, utawa kari kayata &lt;a href="dal"&gt;dal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;cah ayu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iwak%20wedhus"&gt;daging kambing&lt;/a&gt;, iwak utawa &lt;a href="Kari%20pitik"&gt;daging pitik&lt;/a&gt;. Ing &lt;a href="Bhatkal"&gt;Bhatkal&lt;/a&gt;, puttu disajeni karo lawuh kayata ghee lan gula utawa &lt;a href="Paya%20%28panganan%29"&gt;Paya&lt;/a&gt;.
Puttu utamane kasusun saka beras sing digiling kasar, klapa parut, uyah sethithik lan banyu. Asring dibumbui karo &lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;jinten&lt;/a&gt;, nanging bisa uga ana rempah-rempah liyane. Varian Sri Lanka biasane digawe nganggo glepung gandum utawa glepung beras abang tanpa jinten, nanging resep Bhatkal duwe klapa polos utawa varian &lt;a href="Bumbu%20campur"&gt;masala&lt;/a&gt; sing digawe karo kelapa parut rasa daging utawa udang. Ing &lt;a href="Banggalad%C3%A9sa"&gt;Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, njaba digawe saka campuran &lt;a href="glepung%20beras"&gt;glepung beras&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kacang%20ijo"&gt;moong dal&lt;/a&gt; sing digiling, dene isine yaiku campuran serpihan klapa lan jinis gula karamel sing padha karo &lt;a href="dulce%20de%20leche"&gt;dulce de leche&lt;/a&gt;. 
