Salad kacang arab

Salad kacang buncis, utawa luwih asring diarani salad hummus (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: سلطة حمص‎‎), ya iku tembung Arab kanggo 'chickpea', minangka &lt;a href="salad"&gt;salad&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Olahan%20Arab"&gt;masakan Arab&lt;/a&gt;. Isine &lt;a href="Chickpea"&gt;kacang buncis sing&lt;/a&gt; wis mateng, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="tahini"&gt;tahini&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lenga%20ja%C3%A9tun"&gt;lenga zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Jinten%20putih"&gt;jinten&lt;/a&gt;. Varian bisa uga kalebu ketumbar, paprika manis, kunir, mrico, mint disigar, bawang disigar, utawa parsley.
