<doc id="182709" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182709" title="Tokaido Shinkansen">
Tokaido Shinkansen

Tokaido Shinkansen (東海道新幹線, Tōkaidō Shinkansen) yaiku jalur &lt;a href="sepur%20kacepetan%20dhuwur"&gt;sepur kacepetan dhuwur&lt;/a&gt; Jepang sing dadi bagéan saka jaringan &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; nasional. Bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Sanyo%20Shinkansen"&gt;Sanyo Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, iku mbentuk jalur sepur kacepetan dhuwur sing terus-terusan liwat &lt;a href="Sabuk%20Taiheiy%C5%8D"&gt;Sabuk Taiheiyō&lt;/a&gt;, uga dikenal koridor Tokaido. Dibukak ing taun 1964, lumaku ing antarane &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Shin-%C5%8Csaka"&gt;Shin-Ōsaka&lt;/a&gt;, iku jalur sepur kacepetan dhuwur kapisan ing Jepang. Bebarengan karo dadi jalur sepur kacepetan dhuwur paling tuwa ing donya, iku uga salah siji sing paling akeh digunakake. Wiwit taun 1987 wis dioperasèkaké déning &lt;a href="Central%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;Central Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR Central), sadurungé déning &lt;a href="Japanese%20National%20Railways"&gt;Japanese National Railways&lt;/a&gt; (JNR).
Ana telung jinis layanan ing jalur kasebut: saka paling cepet nganti paling alon, yaiku mandeg sing winates &lt;a href="Nozomi%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Nozomi&lt;/a&gt;, sing semi-cepet &lt;a href="Hikari%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Hikari&lt;/a&gt;, lan kabeh-mandeg &lt;a href="Kodama%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Kodama&lt;/a&gt;. Akeh sepur Nozomi lan Hikari terus menyang San'yō Shinkansen, nganti tekan &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Hakata"&gt;Stasiun Hakata&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Fukuoka%2C%20Fukuoka"&gt;Fukuoka&lt;/a&gt;.
