<doc id="182720" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182720" title="Migettuwatte Gunananda Thera">
Migettuwatte Gunananda Thera

Migettuwatte Gunananda Thera utawa Mohottiwatte Gunananda Thera (&lt;a href="Basa%20Sinhala"&gt;Sinhala&lt;/a&gt;: පූජ්‍ය මිගෙට්ටුවත්තේ ගුණානන්ද හිමි) (#ALIH) yaiku seorang ahli wicara &lt;a href="Buddhis"&gt;Buddhis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sri%20Lanka"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt; (Sinhala). Ia dikenal amargi mimpin pihak Buddhis ing debat-debat sing dianakake antara Buddhis lan Kristen ing Baddegama, Udanwita, Waragoda, Liyanagemulla, &lt;a href="Gampola"&gt;Gampola&lt;/a&gt;, lan ing debat sing paling misuwur ing &lt;a href="Panadura"&gt;Panadura&lt;/a&gt;. Minangka asil saka debat-debat kasebut, &lt;a href="Agami%20Buddha%20ing%20Sri%20Lanka"&gt;Agami Buddha ing Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt; ngalami kebangkitan maneh. Sawise maca pamflet babagan debat-debat sing diterbitake ing Amerika Sarekat, &lt;a href="Henry%20Steel%20Olcott"&gt;Henry Steel Olcott&lt;/a&gt; teka menyang &lt;a href="Sri%20Lanka"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt; ing 1880.
