<doc id="182767" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182767" title="Atchara">
Atchara

Atchara (uga dieja achara utawa atsara), yaiku &lt;a href="Pangaseman"&gt;acar sing&lt;/a&gt; digawe saka &lt;a href="Kat%C3%A8s"&gt;pepaya&lt;/a&gt; grated grated populer ing &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;. Panganan iki asring disajikake minangka &lt;a href="Panganan%20sisih"&gt;lawuh&lt;/a&gt; kanggo panganan goreng utawa panggang kayata daging babi.
<h2>Preparasi</h2>
Preparasi.
&lt;a href="Kat%C3%A8s"&gt;Bahan utama yaiku papaya&lt;/a&gt; parut sing durung mateng. Irisan &lt;a href="Wortel%20jangan"&gt;wortel&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ja%C3%A9"&gt;, jahe&lt;/a&gt; julienned, &lt;a href="Lombok%20lonc%C3%A8ng"&gt;lada lada&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bawang"&gt;bawang putih kalebu&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Janganan"&gt;sayuran&lt;/a&gt; liyane. &lt;a href="Kismis"&gt;Raisins&lt;/a&gt; utawa tulisan nanas bisa ditambahake, lan chilis, anyar lemah ireng mrico, flakes abang mrico, utawa kabèh &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;peppercorns&lt;/a&gt; ngrampungake dicampur. Iki banjur dicampur ing larutan &lt;a href="cuka"&gt;cuka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gula"&gt;gula&lt;/a&gt; / &lt;a href="sirup"&gt;sirup&lt;/a&gt;, lan wadi &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;.Campuran kasebut dilebokake ing toples sing adhem, supaya ora disimpen ing adhem, nanging yen dibukak luwih becik digawe adhem kanggo njaga rasane.
<h2>Varian</h2>
<ul>
<li>Atcharang maasim (asinan asem) - disiapake kanthi cara sing padha karo Atchara normal, kajaba ora ana gula sing ditambahake.</li>
<li>Labuhan Atcharang (tunas pring acar) - disiapake kanthi cara sing padha karo Atchara, nanging nggunakake &lt;a href="Bung"&gt;tunas pring&lt;/a&gt; tinimbang papaya.</li>
<li>Atcharang dampalit (picklane sagara acar) - digawe saka Sesuvium portulacastrum, diarani dampalit ing basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Tagalog"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Ubud Atcharang (&lt;a href="Pondhoh"&gt;ati&lt;/a&gt; pickled) - digawe saka jantung sawit, diarani ubod ing basa Tagalog.</li>
<li>Sayuran Atcharang (&lt;a href="Labu%20siam"&gt;chayote&lt;/a&gt; acar) - digawe saka &lt;a href="Labu%20siam"&gt;chayote&lt;/a&gt;, lada, wortel, lan jahe.</li>
</ul>
