Feijoada

Feijoada (Portuguese pronunciation: [fejʒuˈadɐ]) yaiku &lt;a href="Godhogan"&gt;rebusan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Buncis"&gt;kacang buncis&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="P%C3%A9rangan%20daging%20sapi"&gt;daging sapi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="daging%20babi"&gt;daging babi&lt;/a&gt;. Umume disiapake ing &lt;a href="Portegal"&gt;Portugal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Angola"&gt;Angola&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pongol%20Verd%C3%A9"&gt;Cape Verde&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Guin%C3%A9a-Bissau"&gt;Guinea-Bissau&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mozambik"&gt;Mozambik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Timor"&gt;Timor&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Timor%20Kulon"&gt;Timor Lor&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Timor%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Timor Lor&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Goa"&gt;Goa&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Makau"&gt;Macau&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga dianggep minangka olahan nasional. Nanging, resep rada beda saka siji negara menyang negara liyane. 
Bahan dhasar feijoada yaiku kacang buncis karo daging babi seger utawa daging sapi. Ing Brasil, biasane digawe nganggo kacang ireng (feijoada à brasileira). Gobis paling apik disiapake kanthi panas sing sithik ing pot lempung sing kandel.
Biasane disedhiyakake karo &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;sega&lt;/a&gt; lan macem-macem sosis kayata &lt;a href="Chorizo"&gt;chouriço&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sosis%20getih"&gt;morcela&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="sosis%20getih"&gt;sosis getih&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="farinheira"&gt;farinheira&lt;/a&gt;, lan liya-liyane, sing bisa dimasak utawa ora dimasak ing rebusan.
