<doc id="182829" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182829" title="Tom khlong">
Tom khlong

Tom khlong (#ALIH,]) yaiku sup sing kecut lan pedhes kanthi &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; garing sing diasupan lan macem-macem &lt;a href="Herba"&gt;jamu&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Katrangan</h2>
Katrangan.
Tom khlong minangka panganan tradhisional &lt;a href="Thai"&gt;Thai&lt;/a&gt; sing padha karo &lt;a href="Tom%20yam"&gt;tom yum&lt;/a&gt;, kajaba nggunakake jamu sing wis garing utawa dipanggang. Ana jeneng alternatif kanggo wong Thai kuna kanggo tom khlong diarani tom hok ue (#ALIH,] ; Hok ue yaiku unen-unen kang diucapake wong nalika nyedhot) amarga nalika nyedhot bakal nuwuhake rasa kang sumilir.
Ana macem-macem jinis jamu ing tom khlong gumantung carane sampeyan masak nanging bahan sing paling penting yaiku &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt; garing, macem-macem iwak garing (kadhangkala iwak seger digunakake); &lt;a href="galangal"&gt;galangal&lt;/a&gt;, sing digunakake kanggo ngilangi bau amis; Godhong &lt;a href="jeruk%20purut"&gt;jeruk purut&lt;/a&gt;, uga digunakake kanggo ngilangi bau amis; &lt;a href="suket%20lemon"&gt;Lemon suket&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brambang"&gt;Bawang merah&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Lombok%20rawit"&gt;cabe Thailand&lt;/a&gt; garing. Kajaba iku, &lt;a href="paprika"&gt;paprika&lt;/a&gt; bisa ditambahake kanggo rempah-rempah tambahan. Bahan liyane uga kadhangkala ditambahake kanggo nambah rasa lan tekstur, kayata jus &lt;a href="Jeruk%20limau"&gt;jeruk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tomat"&gt;Tomat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Selasih"&gt;Basil&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="P%C3%A9ters%C3%A9li"&gt;Parsley&lt;/a&gt;.
