<doc id="182832" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182832" title="Roti lapis pitik pedhes">
Roti lapis pitik pedhes

Sandwich pitik pedhes yaiku salah sawijining jinis olahan &lt;a href="Sandwich"&gt;roti isi&lt;/a&gt; sing digawe saka dhadha &lt;a href="Daging%20putih"&gt;putih&lt;/a&gt; tanpa balung &lt;a href="Iwak%20pitik"&gt;pitik&lt;/a&gt; sing &lt;a href="Panir"&gt;rotine&lt;/a&gt; dibumbui karo campuran mrico lan rempah-rempah. Bumbu sing umum kalebu &lt;a href="Bubuk%20bawang"&gt;bubuk bawang putih, bubuk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bubuk%20brambang"&gt;bawang bombay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Or%C3%A9gano"&gt;oregano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paprika"&gt;paprika asap&lt;/a&gt;, cayenne, &lt;a href="uyah"&gt;uyah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mrica"&gt;mrico retak&lt;/a&gt;, jus &lt;a href="Jalap%C3%A9%C3%B1o"&gt;jalapeno&lt;/a&gt;, lan serpihan &lt;a href="Bubuk%20lombok%20abang"&gt;mrico abang sing ditumbuk&lt;/a&gt;, sing diudhek ing remah roti. Ayam bisa brined yen dikarepake lan banjur dicelupake ing &lt;a href="Saos%20pedhes"&gt;sauce panas&lt;/a&gt; lan / utawa &lt;a href="Susu%20mert%C3%A9ga"&gt;buttermilk&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="endhog"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, breaded karo &lt;a href="glepung"&gt;glepung&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pathi%20jagung"&gt;cornstarch&lt;/a&gt;, breadcrumbs, rempah-rempah, etc.; lan banjur dipanggang, &lt;a href="Pr%C3%A9sto"&gt;dimasak kanthi tekanan&lt;/a&gt;, utawa digoreng nganggo lenga kayata lenga &lt;a href="Lenga%20kacang"&gt;kacang&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Lenga%20kanola"&gt;lenga canola&lt;/a&gt;. A smoky, saus cabe utawa sriracha mayo utawa nyebar karo bahan kayata mayonnaise, &lt;a href="Saos%20Holland"&gt;sauce Dijon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="L%C3%A9mon"&gt;jus lemon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sl%C3%A8dri"&gt;wiji celery&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Timun%20acar"&gt;jus pickle&lt;/a&gt;, sauce panas, lan mrico ireng anyar lemah, bisa digunakake. Umume sandwich pitik disedhiyakake ing &lt;a href="Kaiser%20gulung"&gt;gulungan kaiser&lt;/a&gt; kanthi topping kaya mayo, selada es, tomat, kubis sing disigar, &lt;a href="Timun%20acar"&gt;irisan acar roti lan mentega&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="coleslaw"&gt;coleslaw&lt;/a&gt;, utawa keju Monterey Jack.
