Sup kepiting minangka sup &lt;a href="Soto"&gt;sing&lt;/a&gt; sugih, padha karo bisque, digawe saka &lt;a href="susu"&gt;susu&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Krim%20%28omb%C3%A8nan%29"&gt;krim abot&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kepithing"&gt;kepiting&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Kaldhu"&gt;stok iwak&lt;/a&gt;, daging kepiting biru Atlantik, lan (cara tradisional) kepiting &lt;a href="Endhog%20iwak"&gt;roe&lt;/a&gt;, lan sawetara sherry garing ditambahake nalika dilapisi. Bisa uga dikentalake kanthi ngurangi panas utawa nganggo &lt;a href="Pur%C3%A9"&gt;purée&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Pantun"&gt;beras&lt;/a&gt; sing digodhog; bisa uga kalebu bumbu kayata &lt;a href="Pala"&gt;gada&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Brambang"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt; bombay utawa &lt;a href="Bawang%20bombay"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;. Sup minangka spesialisasi regional saka Tidewater Virginia, South Carolina Lowcountry lan pesisir &lt;a href="Georgia%20%28praja%29"&gt;Georgia&lt;/a&gt;. Biasane ditampilake ing menu akeh &lt;a href="R%C3%A9storan"&gt;restoran&lt;/a&gt; Charleston, South Carolina lan &lt;a href="Savannah%2C%20Georgia"&gt;Savannah, Georgia&lt;/a&gt;. 
Sup iki dijenengi kanggo "kepiting wadon", utawa kepiting wadon, asline kepiting &lt;a href="Graviditas%20lan%20paritas"&gt;gravid&lt;/a&gt;, amarga kepiting oranye minangka bahan utama ing sup kepiting tradisional. Kaya &lt;a href="Sop%20bulus"&gt;sup penyu&lt;/a&gt;, bahan liyane bisa ditambahake ing sup utawa diganti karo liyane, sanajan &lt;a href="Daging%20yuyu"&gt;daging kepiting&lt;/a&gt; ditemokake ing kabeh versi.
