Roti lapis Monte Cristo

Sandwich Monte Cristo minangka sandwich &lt;a href="Roti%20lapis%20ham"&gt;ham lan keju sing dicelup&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Adhonan%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; sing &lt;a href="Nggangsa"&gt;digoreng&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Gor%C3%A8ng%20kungkum"&gt;digoreng&lt;/a&gt;, variasi saka &lt;a href="croque%20monsieur"&gt;croque monsieur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olah-olahan%20Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; ('Mister Crunchy').
Wiwit taun 1930-an nganti 1960-an, &lt;a href="American%20cookbooks%20ing%20taun%201950-an"&gt;buku masak Amerika duwe&lt;/a&gt; resep-resep kanggo &lt;a href="Sandwich"&gt;roti isi&lt;/a&gt; iki kanthi jeneng "sandwich Prancis", "sandwich ham panggang", lan " &lt;a href="Roti%20isi%20k%C3%A8ju"&gt;sandwich keju&lt;/a&gt; panggang Prancis". Sandwich Monte Cristo mesthine lumebu ing adegan ing taun 1960-an ing &lt;a href="California%20Kidul"&gt;California Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, lan njeblug popularitas sawise &lt;a href="Restoran%20Blue%20Bayou"&gt;Restoran Blue Bayou&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Disneyland"&gt;Disneyland&lt;/a&gt; wiwit ngladeni.
<h2>Katrangan</h2>
Katrangan.
Ing pirang-pirang wilayah, sandwic luwih gurih tinimbang manis. Cara tradisional, dicelupake kabeh ing &lt;a href="Endhog%20minangka%20panganan"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt; sing diantemi lan &lt;a href="Nggangsa"&gt;digoreng&lt;/a&gt;, sanajan bisa uga digoreng. Variasi regional bisa uga kalebu irisan &lt;a href="Iwak%20kalkun"&gt;kalkun&lt;/a&gt;. Ing sawetara wilayah ing US contiguous dadi panggang; ing liyane, iku &lt;a href="Roti%20isi%20kabuka"&gt;roti isi mbukak&lt;/a&gt; karo mung roti endhog-dipped lan sandwich nglumpuk digawe panas rada ing Panggangan utawa broiler. Sawetara restoran nyedhiyakake variasi yaiku &lt;a href="Adhonan%20kuw%C3%A9"&gt;adonan&lt;/a&gt; - dicelupake lan digoreng. Monte Cristo kadhangkala ditutupi &lt;a href="Gula%20alus"&gt;gula bubuk&lt;/a&gt; lan disuguhake karo &lt;a href="Sirup%20mapel"&gt;sirup maple&lt;/a&gt; utawa pengawet.
