<doc id="182961" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182961" title="Kabiskopan Saint John's–Basseterre">
Kabiskopan Saint John's–Basseterre

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Kabiskopan Saint John's–Basseterre (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Dioecesis Sancti Ioannis–Imatelluranus) yaiku &lt;a href="kabiskopan"&gt;kabiskopan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Greja%20Katulik%20Roma"&gt;Greja Katulik Roma&lt;/a&gt; sing berbasis ing &lt;a href="St.%20John%27s%2C%20Antigua%20lan%20Barbuda"&gt;St. John's&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Antigua"&gt;Antigua&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Antigua%20lan%20Barbuda"&gt;Antigua lan Barbuda&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan iki uga ngeliputi wilayah &lt;a href="Anguilla"&gt;Anguilla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Antigua%20kan%20Barbuda"&gt;Antigua kan Barbuda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kapuloan%20Virgin%20Britania%20Raya"&gt;Kapuloan Virgin Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Montserrat"&gt;Montserrat&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Saint%20Kitts%20lan%20Nevis"&gt;Saint Kitts lan Nevis&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan iki didehake minangka Kabiskopan Saint John's, asil pamekaran saka &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Roseau"&gt;Kabiskopan Roseau&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="16%20Januari"&gt;16 Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1971"&gt;1971&lt;/a&gt;. Kabiskopan iki ana ing wilayah &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Castries"&gt;Provinsi Grejawi Castries&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Saint%20Lucia"&gt;Saint Lucia&lt;/a&gt;. Pusat keuskupan berada di &lt;a href="Katedral%20Keluarga%20Kudus%2C%20St.%20John%27s"&gt;Katedral Keluarga Kudus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saint%20John%27s"&gt;Saint John's&lt;/a&gt;. Saat ini, tahta keuskupan dipimpin dening &lt;a href="Robert%20Anthony%20Llanos"&gt;Robert Anthony Llanos&lt;/a&gt; sing terpilih ing 18 Desember 2018, sawise sadurunge menika Biskop Auksilier &lt;a href="Kabiskopan%20Agung%20Port%20of%20Spain"&gt;Kabiskopan Agung Port of Spain&lt;/a&gt; lan Administrator Apostolik kabiskopan sawise &lt;a href="20%20Juni"&gt;20 Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2016"&gt;2016&lt;/a&gt;.
