<doc id="182977" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182977" title="Burrito sarapan">
Burrito sarapan

Sarapan burrito, kadhangkala diarani bungkus sarapan ing njaba Southwest American, yaiku macem-macem &lt;a href="sarapan"&gt;sarapan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Olahan%20Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika sing kalebu&lt;/a&gt; barang sarapan sing dibungkus ing jero tortilla &lt;a href="burrito"&gt;burrito&lt;/a&gt; tepung. Gaya iki ditemokake lan dipopulerake ing sawetara masakan Amerika regional, utamane asale saka &lt;a href="Olahan%20New%20Mexico"&gt;masakan New Mexico&lt;/a&gt;, lan ngembang ing njaba masakan Southwestern lan tetanggan &lt;a href="T%C3%A9x-M%C3%A9x"&gt;Tex-Mexico&lt;/a&gt;. Burrito sarapan gaya barat daya bisa uga ngemot kombinasi &lt;a href="Endhog%20orak-arik"&gt;endhog&lt;/a&gt;, kentang, keju, mrico (biasane cabai New Mexico, &lt;a href="Jalap%C3%A9%C3%B1o"&gt;Jalapeño&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="Lombok%20abang"&gt;mrica cabai&lt;/a&gt; liyane), salsa, bawang, &lt;a href="chorizo"&gt;chorizo&lt;/a&gt;, daging babi, utawa krim sing ora nguntungke. 
Sawetara restoran panganan cepat saji kayata Burger King, Dunkin 'Donuts, McDonald's lan Taco Bell adol sarapan burrito. Sarapan burrito uga &lt;a href="Panganan%20pinggir%20dalan"&gt;panganan ing dalan&lt;/a&gt;. 
