<doc id="182978" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=182978" title="Hot dog vegetarian">
Hot dog vegetarian

Hot dog vegetarian yaiku &lt;a href="hot%20dog"&gt;hot dog&lt;/a&gt; sing diprodhuksi kanthi lengkap saka produk non-daging. Ora kaya sosis daging buatan omah tradisional, casing ora digawe saka usus, nanging saka selulosa utawa bahan tanduran liyane. Isi biasane adhedhasar sawetara jinis protein &lt;a href="Dhel%C3%A9"&gt;soy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gluten%20gandum"&gt;gluten gandum&lt;/a&gt;, utawa &lt;a href="protein%20kacang%20polong"&gt;protein kacang polong&lt;/a&gt;. Sawetara bisa ngemot putih endhog, sing bakal nggawe dheweke ora cocog kanggo vegetarian lacto utawa diet &lt;a href="Veganisme"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;.
