<li>RumChata saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt;, campuran &lt;a href="Rum%20%28unjukan%20mawi%20alkohol%29"&gt;rum&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="horchata"&gt;horchata&lt;/a&gt;</li>

