<doc id="183110" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183110" title="Lo mai gai">
Lo mai gai

Lo mai gai (Chinese), kanthi harfiah "ayam ketan", minangka sajian &lt;a href="dim%20sum"&gt;dim sum&lt;/a&gt; klasik sing disuguhake nalika yum cha. Ukuran porsi lo mai gai umume cukup gedhe, mula ana varian sing luwih cilik sing diarani jan jyu gai (Chinese).
Lo mai gai biasane panganan &lt;a href="Cina%20Lor%20lan%20kidul"&gt;Cina kidul&lt;/a&gt;. Isine beras ketan sing diisi pitik, &lt;a href="Shiitake"&gt;jamur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sosis%20China"&gt;Cina, sosis Cina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Loncang"&gt;bawang bombay&lt;/a&gt;, lan kadhangkala &lt;a href="Urang%20%28k%C3%A9wan%29"&gt;udang&lt;/a&gt; garing utawa endhog asin. Sega werni banjur dibungkus godhong &lt;a href="Padma"&gt;teratai&lt;/a&gt; garing lan dikukus. Ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Lor"&gt;Amerika Utara&lt;/a&gt;, godhong &lt;a href="Godhong%20gedhang"&gt;gedhang&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Godhong%20anggur"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt; bisa digunakake.
