<doc id="183138" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=183138" title="Jōetsu Shinkansen">
Jōetsu Shinkansen

Jōetsu Shinkansen (上越新幹線, Jōetsu Shinkansen) yaiku jalur sepur &lt;a href="shinkansen"&gt;shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; kacepetan dhuwur sing nyambungake &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Niigata%2C%20Niigata"&gt;Niigata&lt;/a&gt;, Jepang, liwat &lt;a href="T%C5%8Dhoku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Tōhoku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;, dioperasikake dening &lt;a href="East%20Japan%20Railway%20Company"&gt;East Japan Railway Company&lt;/a&gt; (JR East). Senajan jenenge, jalur iki ora ngliwati &lt;a href="Joetsu%2C%20Niigata"&gt;Joetsu&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="J%C5%8Detsu%20region"&gt;wilayah Jōetsu&lt;/a&gt; sing bersejarah, kosok baline sing malah diladèni déning &lt;a href="Hokuriku%20Shinkansen"&gt;Hokuriku Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Layanan sepur</h2>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Toki%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Toki&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Niigata (winates-mandeg)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Tanigawa%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Tanigawa&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Echigo-Yuzawa (kabeh stasiun, wiwit Oktober 1997)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Layanan mandheg</h3>
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="Asahi%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Asahi&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Niigata (dilereni ing Desember 2002)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Asahi%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Max Asahi&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Niigata (dilereni ing Desember 2002)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Toki%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Max Toki&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Niigata (dilereni ing Oktober 2021)</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Tanigawa%20%28sepur%29"&gt;Max Tanigawa&lt;/a&gt;, Tokyo – Echigo-Yuzawa (dilereni ing Oktober 2021)</li>
</ul>
<h2>Stasiun</h2>
Stasiun.
Legenda:
&lt;a href="Gala-Yuzawa%20Line"&gt;Jalur Gala-Yuzawa&lt;/a&gt; minangka cabang 1.8 km saka Echigo-Yuzawa menyang &lt;a href="Stasiun%20Gala-Yuzawa"&gt;Stasiun Gala-Yuzawa&lt;/a&gt;. Iku mung beroprasi ing sasi adhem, nglayani resor ski ing jejere.
Ing 2012, kacepetan maksimum jalur punika 110 km/h antarane Tokyo lan Omiya, lan 245 km/h antarane Omiya lan Niigata. Kajaba iku, sepur menyang Tokyo duwe watesan sing luwih dhuwur 275 km/h antarane Jōmō-Kōgen lan Urasa. Kayata kabeh jalur &lt;a href="Shinkansen"&gt;Shinkansen&lt;/a&gt; liyane, Jōetsu Shinkansen minangka migunakake &lt;a href="sepur%20standar"&gt;sepur standar&lt;/a&gt;.
